The '''Total Wars''' or '''Total War Season Specials''' are a group of event stages specific to each season.

==List of Stages==
Each Total War has five stages containing enemies from the season's [[:Category:Monthly Events|monthly events]]. The stages' rewards can only be collected once per appearance, and include XP in stages 1, 2 and 4, three [[Cat Capsule#Normal Cat Capsule|Cat Tickets]] in stage 3, and a [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Ticket]] on the final stage. Each successive Total War is more difficult but has better XP rewards, with [[Total War: Spring Special]] being the easiest and [[Total War: Winter Special]] being the hardest. The Total Wars are unlocked by clearing their respective season's main monthly events (i.e., [[Total War: Spring Special]] is unlocked after [[Bears be Bare (Monthly Event)|Bears be Bare]], [[Teacher! It's Spring! (Monthly Event)|Teacher! It's Spring!]] and [[Love is Sickness (Monthly Event)|Love is Sickness]] are cleared).

